    {
      "id": "jsonsample_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 522.5,
      "width": 276,
      "height": 245,
      "text": "响应长这样(20 题实测过):\n{\n  \"回答\": \"病假工资 9600 元\",\n  \"路由\": [\n    { \"name\": \"search_knowledge\",\n      \"arguments\": {…},\n      \"evidence\": [\n        { \"来源\": \"检索\", \"相似度\": 0.7,\n          \"文件名\": \"…\", \"文件内容\": \"…\" } ] },\n    { \"name\": \"web_search\",  … },\n    { \"name\": \"calculate\",   … }\n  ]\n}\n失败时 evidence=null;拒答也有检索记录",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jsonsample",
      "originalText": "响应长这样(20 题实测过):\n{\n  \"回答\": \"病假工资 9600 元\",\n  \"路由\": [\n    { \"name\": \"search_knowledge\",\n      \"arguments\": {…},\n      \"evidence\": [\n        { \"来源\": \"检索\", \"相似度\": 0.7,\n          \"文件名\": \"…\", \"文件内容\": \"…\" } ] },\n    { \"name\": \"web_search\",  … },\n    { \"name\": \"calculate\",   … }\n  ]\n}\n失败时 evidence=null;拒答也有检索记录",
